4. HYP-9458 closed forms from the recurrence (n up to 60)
  OK   T(n,2) = 2^(n-5) for 5 <= n <= 60 (fails at n = [4], below the stated range)
  OK   T(n,3) = n 2^(n-7) for 6 <= n <= 60 (fails at n = [4, 5], below the stated range)
  OK   T(n,4) = (n^2+n-8) 2^(n-10) for 7 <= n <= 60 (fails at n = [4, 5, 6], below the stated range)
  OK   top diagonal N(n,2) = 1 for 5 <= n <= 60
  OK   top diagonal N(n,3) = n - 4 for 5 <= n <= 60
  OK   top diagonal N(n,4) = C(n-3,2) for 5 <= n <= 60
  note's T(n,3) = 2^(n-7) + 2 T(n-1,3) fails at n in [6] (valid for n >= 7)
  note's T(n,4) = n 2^(n-9) + 2 T(n-1,4) fails at n in [7] (valid for n >= 8)
  OK   symbolic: T2 satisfies T(n,2) = 2T(n-1,2) (T(.,1) = 0)
  OK   symbolic: T3 satisfies T(n,3) = T(n-1,2) + 2T(n-1,3) - T(n-2,2)
  OK   symbolic: T4 satisfies T(n,4) = T(n-1,3) + 2T(n-1,4) - T(n-2,3)

